<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">Jakob</book>
  <para style="h">Jakob</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jakob</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jakob</para>
  <para style="mt">Jakob</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob, Pasian leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist suohpa’n nam sawm leh ni kithezahte anousiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, ze etna chituom tuom na tuoh chiengun, lungnopna ngenin ngaisut un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ginna uh, ze etna in kukalna asiem hi chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh bangma tasamloua na pichin ua, na bukim theina dingun, thuohhatna in sem bukim heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lah ua Koipou in pilna atahsap leh mi zousie kunga it lou leh house lou a pepa Pasian kungah ngen heh, tuachi’n akungah pieh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh aman gingla hetlouin, gingta tahin ngen heh, aziehpen gingla mi khu tuipi kinawh, hui mut leeng leh seep bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuabang miin Mangpa akipat bangma mu ding kinem sih heh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama lungsim thuoni nei ahia, asil bawl zousie akip sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khosahna ngiem unaupa khu pahtawi a aum ziehin kipah heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh mi hausa khu suhngiem a aum ziehin lungkim heh, aziehpen loupa pah banga mang ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen ni ahing suoh a asat mama chiengin loupate avul pai a, apahte apul a, akilawmnate amuol a amangta hi, tuamabangin mihausate zong asummet bawl lai un avuoi mang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ze etna thuoh teitei mi khu ahampha hi, aziehpen etkhieh a aum zou chiengin Mangpa’n Ama itte kunga pieh dinga achiemsa hinna manglukhu asang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi koima’n solna atuoh chiengin, “Pasian sol ka hi,” chi sih heh, Pasian pen gitlou a solguol ahi sih a, Aman zong koima asol ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Michin amauh utna a kaimang leh hipmanga a um chieng ua, sol a um ahizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n utnain nou apai chiengin khelna apiengsah a, tualeh khelna ahing pichin chiengin shina ahing tun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka unau ittahte aw, sol in um sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Silpieh hoi leh silpieh bukim pouma tunglam a kipan ahia, vahte Pa kunga kipata hing peisuh ahi a, Ama ah lamdanna leh kikhelna lim mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asilsiemte laha ga masa pawl khat i hitheina dingin Ama deidan thutah a ahing piensah ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka unau ittahte aw, michin thu ngaikhieh lam ah kilawp henlen, thugen lam ah kikangkoiin lungthah bai sih heh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen mihing lungthahnain Pasian dihtatna apiengsah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuazieh in niehna zousie leh gitlouna dimlet koimang unlen, na hinna uh hundam thei na sung ua thu kitusate lungnemtahin pom un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh nouma leh nouma kisol in thungaikhe maimai hilouin, thuzuite hi zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen mi koipou thu ngaikhie a, azuitu ahi sih leh ama pen mi himlanga apienpi mai ki en bang giap ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aki en a, apei manga, tualeh bangchibang melpuo ahiei chi akimanghil pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh koipou noplenna dan bukim en a, tua khu zui den a, manghilhat thungaikhie hilou a, thu zui mi ahileh, tuabang mi khu anasep ah guolzawlna amu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na lah ua mi koipou sakhomitah bang a kingaituo a alei veng hoi lou a, ama leh ama akisol leh tua mipa sakhuo bieh khu athawn ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pasian leh Pa mitmu a, sakhuo biehna sieng leh nieh banglou khu, nubei pabeite leh meithaite alungkham lai ua va ve leh leitunga nieh banglou a kikep ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, i Mangpa Jesu Khrist, thupina Mangpa gingta kawmin mi khentuom nei sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na kikhopna uah sana khutsip bun, puon hoitah sil khat hing lut henlen, tualeh mi zawng khat, puon senipnep sil in hinglut ta leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh puon hoi sil mi pen na limbawl ua, akungah “Nang tam mun hoi ah tou in,” na chi ua, tualeh mi zawng pa kungah, “Nang tuanah na dingin,” ahisihleh “Tanah ka keng ngahna bul ah touin,” na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lah uah khentuom na nei uh hilou ahiei amah, tualeh gitlou lungsim nei a thukhen na hi sih ding uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka unau ittahte Ngai un, Pasian in tam leitunga mizawngte khu ginna a hausa ding leh Ama itte kunga achiemsa gam luo dinga atel hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten mi zawngte na zalasah uhi. Mihausaten noute ahing bawlsie un, thukhenna inn ah ahing kailut zel uh hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute hilou amah noute hing kihatna min manpha gensie?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Laisiengthou dungzui a, “Nangma na ki it banga na innvengte na it ding ahi,” chi kumpi dan na suhtangtung u’leh na bawl hoi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh mi khentuom na nei u’leh, khelna bawl na hi uhi, tualeh dan in danbotsetu bangin ahing mawpai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi koipouin dan zuikim henlen, munkhat ah zuila taleh dan zousie tung a khiel ahita veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Aziehpen angkawm sin,” chipa’n “Tuolthat sin” zong achi thou hi, tuachi’n angkawm sih lachin zong tuol na tha leh, dan botsepa na hita veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin zalenna dan a vaihawmpieh dingte bangin thu gen unlen, sil bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen khotuona neilou mi khu khotuona beia vaihawmpiehin a um ding hi, khotuona in thukhenna a zou zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka unaute aw mi’n ginna ka nei chi henlen nasep nei sih leh, bang aphatuom diei? Tuabang ginna in ama ahundam thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Unaupa ahiei, unaunu ahiei khat guohtangin um henlen nichin neh ding tasamta henlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Na lah ua khat in lungmuong tahin um inlen, lumtah leh gilva tahin umin” chi henlen, atahsapum tahsapte pe sih leh, bang aphatuom diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachimabangin ginna in nasep anei sih leh ashi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh mi khat in, “Nang ginna na nei a, ken nasep ka nei hi,” achikha ding hi. Na ginna khu nasep panglou in hing ensah inlen, Ken ka ginna ka nasep in ka hing ensah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasian khat aum chi na gingta hi. Hoi e. Dawite nangawn in agingta ua, achitun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Oh nang mi mo, nasep panglou ginna khu ashi ahi chi na thei nuom ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ipu uh Abraham in atapa Isaak maitam tunga alat laiin, nasep zieh a siemtang hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gin na in anasepte toh asemkhawm a, tualeh nasep in ginna abukimsah hi chi na mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Abraham in Pasian agingta a, tua agintatna khu Pasian in adihtatna in asimpieh hi, chia Laisiengthouin agen atangtung sah hi,” tualeh ama Pasian lawm akichita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n ginna zieh guoh hilouin nasep ziehin mi siemtansah in a um hi chi na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuamabangin kizuanu Rahab in zong thupomite ana zintun a, amaute lam tuom a asawlkhieh lai in, nasep zieh a siemtang hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hagau tellou tahsapumpi pen ashi ahi bangin, nasep panglou ginna khu ashi ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, noute lah a mi tampi thuhilmi in hing pang sih un, ei mi thuhil a pangten thukhenna khauzaw tang ding ihi, chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen i unpi un sil tampi ah i kipalpua uhi. Mi koipou thugen lam a akipalpua sih leh mi piching ahia, tahsa pumpi thunun thei mi zong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai un, ithu aman theina dingun sakolte kamkaina ivaw a, tuachi’n atahsa pumpi ikaihei thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />En un, tembawte lienpipi hinan u’leh, hui hattah sem leng in a um hi, hinanleh tembaw hehpa’n ahehna neu nou khat in a utna lamlam ah akiheisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuamabangin lei zong tahsa bameng neu nou khat ahia, nasatahin aki uongsah zel hi. En un, mei neunoukhat in Gammang thupitah akatum thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh lei pen mei ahia, itahsa bamengte lah a tatsietna lompi khu lei ahi, tuachi’n tahsa pumpi buasahin asesah a, mihing hinkhuo kiheite akasah a, ama zong gawtmun meiin aka zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ganhing namkim, va namkim, abohvah namkim, tuipi sunga silsiem namkimte, mihingin akhawizuol thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh mihing koiman lei akhawizuol thei sih uhi; gitlouna um khinkhian theilou, shina gu a dim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I lei in Pasian leh Pa iphat a, ileima in Pasian batpi a kisiem mihingte ihamsiet zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kamsung khat a kipat in phatna leh hamsietna apawtkhe zel hi. Ka unaute aw, tam silte hichibang ding hilou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuinah khat apat tui sieng leh chitui apawtkhawm thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, theipi kungah Olive aga thei ngai amah, ahisih leh grep gui ah theipi aga thei amah? Tuamabangin chikhuh in zong tuisieng apawtsah thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na lah ua pil leh theisiem koi ahiei um? thunuoilut leh piltahin anasepte khu umdan hoiin ensah heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh na lungtang sung ua, kithangsietna khatah leh angsung khuolna nei na hi u’leh uong sih unlen, zuou thu niel unlen thudih zuousan sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tambang pilna pen tunglama hing kipan ahi sih a, hinanleh leitung leh tahsa utna leh dawi a hing kipan ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen thangsietna leh angsung khuolna umna pou ah, buoina leh sil hoilou chinteng aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh tunglam a hing kipan pilna pen amasapen in asiengthou a, tuachiengin kilemna adei a, anunnem a, gasuo a ut a, khotuona leh ga hoi in adim a, khentuom anei sih a, alepchie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh dihtatna ga khu lemna bawlten kilemna a atu uh ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na lah ua kidounate leh kihaunate heia hing kipan ahiei? Na tahsa hiengte ua kidou leng, na tahsa lunggulnate ua hing kipan a hing pieng hilou amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na lunggul ua nanei tuomsih uhi; tuol na that ua, na deigaw ua, na nei zou tuom sih uhi. Na kihau ua, na kidou uhi. Na ngetlou ziehun na nei tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ngen ua, na nget dihlou zieh un na mu sih uhi, nouma nopsahna dinga zah na tup zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nou angkawmhatte aw, leitung lawm hina khu Pasian toh kimelmatna ahi chi theilou na hi uoi mah? tuaziehin koipou leitung lawm hi ut khu Pasian melmain akibawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahisihleh Laisiengthou in, “Ei ma sunga teng Hagau in thangse khopin ahing dei hi, achi khu amawhgen hiva chia thusimlou na hi uoi mah”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman hepina tamsem ahing pie hi; Tuaziehin Aman: “Pasian in mi kiliensahte adoua, hinanleh kingaingiemte kungah hepina apie hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian kungah kitulut un. Dawimangpa doudal un, tuachi’n aman ahing taimangsan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasian nai un, tuachi’n Aman ahing nai ding hi. Mi khielte aw, na khut uh silsieng un, nou lungsim thuop ni neite na lungtanguh susiengthou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chimaw unlen, lunggim unlen, kap un, na nuina uh lunggimna suoh henlen, na lungnopna uh dana suoh heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasian mitmu in kingaingiem un, tuachi’n Aman ahing tawisang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unaute aw, khat leh khat kigensetuo sih un, Mi aunau gensie leh aunau tunga vaihawm pouma dan gensie ahia, dan tunga vaihawm ahi. Hinanleh dan na gensiet leh, dan zuimi na hi sih a, vaihawmmi na hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dan pepa khat a um a, Aman ahundam theia, asuse thei hi. Midang tunga vaihawm ding nang koi na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hing pei un “Tuni ahiei, zingchieng ahiei in, khum khopi ah ihaw dinga khunah kum khat iva taam ding a, lei in izua ding ua, ipung ding chite aw,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zingchienga bang hing tung ding ahiei, chi na thei sih uhi. Na hinna uh bang ahiei? Tuimei bakhat hing kilang a mang kia pai bang giap ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tua sangin Mangpa’n pha asah leh idam dinga, tami ahiei, tuomi ahiei, ibawl ding, na chi zoh ding uh ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin na ki uongsah ua, na ham uong uhi; tuabanga ki uohsahna zousie khu khelna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin mi sil hoi bawl ding thei napi a, bawl tuonlou khu, ama a ding in khelna ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou mi hausaten tuin ngai un, na tung ua gim thuohna hing tungdingte ziehin kap in mau un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na hausatnate uh asegawpta a, na puonte uh nget in anesiengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na sana u’leh na dangkate uh sam eeh akai siengta hi, tuate sietgawpna khu na kheldan uh theisahna ding ahi dinga, tualeh na tahsa uh meikah bangin anetum ding hi. Nouten lah ni nukhia lam a dingin gou na kholkhawm na lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai un, na lou ua bu-at a kilawte thaman amaute sol a na pieh loute uh akikou ua, tualeh bu-atmite kikou aw khu, mipite Mangpa bil ah alutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leitungah nuomsa leh nuomtat tahin na hing ua, na lungtangte uh gaw ding ni a gantate bangin na vathauta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Midih khu na mawpai ua, na thatta uhi, aman lah noute ahing dou sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka unaute aw, Mangpa hing pei masangsie thuohhattahin um un. En un, lounei miin lei ga manphatah khu angah a, guo masate leh nukhiate amu masangsie thuohhattahin angah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Noute zong thuohhat tahin um un. Na lungtangte uh kipsah un, aziehpen Mangpa hing peina ding anaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unaute aw, khat leh khat kiphunsan sih un, mawpai in na umkha ding uhi. Ngai un, vaihawmpa kotkhah bul ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, Mangpa mina thugen guolneite khu gimthuohna leh thuohhatna lam a etton dingin zangun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai un, athuoh mite hampha in isep uhi. Job thuohhat dan na za uhi, Mangpa’n atawpa abawl tupdan na mu uhi; Mangpa khu lainatna leh khotuona a dim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh ka unau ittahte aw, Bang teng tungah, vanlam lou in ahiei, lei lam lou in ahiei, ahisihleh kihahsielna dang mawngmawngin kichiem sih un. Hinanleh Ahi na chi uh ahi hisah unlen, hilou na chi uh ahilou hisah un, tuachilou in siemmaw tangin na umkha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na lah uah genthei thuoh a um ei? thungen heh. Kipah a um ei? phatna la sa heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na lah uah china a um ei? Hattuom upate han henlen, amauten Mangpa mina sathau nuin thungen uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh ginna a thungetnain china khu adamsah dinga, Mangpa’n ama akaithou ding hi. Tualeh aman khelna ana bawlkhah leh ngaidam ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Suhdam a na um theina dingun na tatkhelnate uh thupha kitawituo chiet unlen, khat leh khat thu kingetpieh un. Mi dihtat thungetna in nna asem thei mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elijah khu eima banga mihing pienken nei ahia, aman guo zuhlouna dingin phatuomngaitahin thu angen a, tuachi’n kum thum leh haguh sung leitung ah guo zulouin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh thu angenkia a, vanin guo a zusah a, lei in agate ahing suongsah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Unaute aw, na lah ua mi koipou, thutah apat pielmang henlen, tualeh mi dang khat in nuapui kiataleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi khiel alam manna akipat kiheisahpa in shina akipat hagau khat ahundam dinga, akhelna tampite akhumang ding ahi, chi kithei heh.
  </para>
</usx>
